# 詞: 睇怕

1. 今日落咁大雨，睇怕佢唔會嚟啦。 (It's raining so heavily today, I'm afraid he won't come.)

2. 佢成日都遲到，睇怕份工都做唔長。 (He's always late. I'm afraid he won't keep this job for long.)

3. 呢個問題咁複雜，睇怕要請專家先搞得掂。 (This problem is so complicated. I'm afraid we need to call in an expert to solve it.)

4. 佢病咗成個禮拜都未好，睇怕要去睇醫生。 (He's been sick for a whole week and hasn't recovered. I'm afraid he needs to see a doctor.)

5. 呢條路塞到咁，睇怕趕唔切搭飛機。 (This road is so jammed. I'm afraid we won't make it to the flight.)

6. 佢成日都唔溫書，睇怕考試會肥佬。 (He never studies. I'm afraid he'll fail the exam.)

7. 呢間餐廳咁多人排隊，睇怕啲嘢食好好味。 (There are so many people queuing at this restaurant. I'm afraid the food must be delicious.)

8. 佢頭先黑口黑面咁，睇怕心情唔好。 (He had a sour face just now. I'm afraid he's in a bad mood.)

9. 呢個計劃咁冒險，睇怕好難成功。 (This plan is so risky. I'm afraid it's very hard to succeed.)

10. 佢成日都唔出聲，睇怕係怕醜。 (He's always quiet. I'm afraid he's shy.) [end of text]


